**Full-app `xcodebuild` gate: DEFERRED (RED), reported honestly** — zero `AITCONarration` production errors. Blockers are pre-existing/environmental and out of scope: `XCTest`-in-app-target across 254 peer co-located tests (P4/P99-owned), `dashboard-widgets` duplicate type definitions (peer surfaces), and macOS dev-signing (no certificate on this runner). The log ends with `EXIT=0` / `STATUS=DONE`.

